    "name": "Seated side support, legs flowing forward",
    "description": "Sitting on the floor with both legs stretched forward and angled slightly to the left heel down, the right arm bracing on the floor out to the side and the left hand resting on the left thigh. The torso leans a little toward the supporting side while the head tilts to the right. Left/right are the character's own.",
