      "female",
      "male"
    ],
    "assumptions": [
      "Single front-view line drawing used as reference; the forward-left flow of the legs is read as a slight pelvis yaw with a counter-turned torso.",
      "Buttocks, right palm and heels share floor contact; root height is the female/male mean within the 10 mm floor tolerance.",
      "Authored on rig/female.glb; the male reuses the same rotations with the hips-height-relative root offset."
    ],
